(29071,48,0,'There... There''s no more time for me. I''m done for. Finish me off, $n. Do it or they''ll kill us both. $n... Remember Teldrassil, our beloved home. This world is worth saving.',12,0,100,0,0,0,29330,'special_surprise SAY_EXEC_TIME_7'),
